SUMMARY:[Inaugural Meeting · Kelowna] Kelowna Inaugural Council Meeting & 
 Swearing-In (2026–2030)
DESCRIPTION:WHEN: Monday\, November 2\, 2026\, 7:00 p.m. to 9:00 p.m. (Kelo
 wna time)\nWHERE: Mary Irwin Theatre\, Rotary Centre for the Arts\, 421 Ca
 wston Ave\, Kelowna\, BC\n\nCATEGORY: Municipal Government\nTYPE: Inaugura
 l Meeting\nJURISDICTION: Kelowna\nFEDERAL RIDING: Kelowna\nTAGS: Open to P
 ublic\, Free\, Livestreamed\, Mayor & Council\, Networking Opportunity\, G
 R Must-Attend\n\nABOUT:\nJudge Clarke Burnett administers the Oath of Offi
 ce to Mayor Tom Dyas and Councillors Les Bellamy\, Kevin Kraft\, Davis Kyl
 e\, Gord Lovegrove\, Brady Rogers\, Mohini Singh\, Laura Thurnheer and Ric
 k Webber. One-hour ceremony followed by a public coffee and appetizer rece
 ption until 9 p.m. Open to the public\; livestreamed at kelowna.ca/council
 . Good networking opportunity with the new council.\n\nWHY IT MATTERS (GOV
 ERNMENT RELATIONS):\nThe first chance to meet the full 2026–2030 Kelowna
  council in an informal setting\; the reception is ideal for introducing y
 ourself to new councillors before their portfolios and committee roles are
  set.\n\nDETAILS:\nOrganizer: City of Kelowna\nWho attends: Mayor Tom Dyas
  and all eight councillors\, Judge Clarke Burnett\, City senior staff\, fa
 milies\, community and business leaders\nCost: Free\nAccess: Open to the p
 ublic\; reception with coffee and appetizers follows the ceremony until 9 
 p.m.\nLivestream: Livestreamed and archived at kelowna.ca/council\n\nSOURC
 E: https://www.am1150.ca/90986/news/municipal-news/city-of-kelowna/new-kel
 owna-city-council-to-be-sworn-in/
LOCATION:Mary Irwin Theatre\, Rotary Centre for the Arts\, 421 Cawston Ave\
 , Kelowna\, BC
CATEGORIES:Municipal Government,Inaugural Meeting,Kelowna,Open to Public,Fr
 ee,Livestreamed,Mayor & Council,Networking Opportunity,GR Must-Attend
URL:https://www.am1150.ca/90986/news/municipal-news/city-of-kelowna/new-kel
 owna-city-council-to-be-sworn-in/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
