 's largest ceremony: a parade from Bernard Ave & Water St to the City Park
  cenotaph\, organized by Royal Canadian Legion Kelowna Branch #26. Elected
  officials lay wreaths. Times are based on past years\; confirm closer to 
 the date.\n\nWHY IT MATTERS (GOVERNMENT RELATIONS):\nNearly every local el
 ected official attends and lays a wreath\; a respectful occasion to be see
 n in the community.\n\nDETAILS:\nOrganizer: Royal Canadian Legion Kelowna 
